;; frozendict (PEP 814, Python 3.15; queue 237): Objects/dictobject.c's frozendict of CPython 3.15.2. An immutable,
;; insertion-ordered mapping, not a dict subclass (its base is object), hashable when its values are: a Dict filled once
;; by the constructor and never changed after. dict's readers take it where 3.15's PyAnyDict_Check does (==, |, the
;; views, dict(fd), dict.update(fd)); the Go paths that take a *Dict do not, so nothing writes into one. Present under
;; the 3.15 switch only (version.go's since315).

